 abstract = {Parallel processing for fuzzy sets operations was discussed. This includes computation of binary operations and fuzzy inferences. Comparator networks was used by the algorithm. Results showed that the binary or arithmetic operations are faster than the classical operations. Classical operations need eight steps in a single processor computation whereas binary operations require only four parallel steps.},
